	"bodyHtml": "<div class=\"d--flex\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-83\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--soft-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\" data-span=\"full-desktop\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h1>Happy dog =<br>happy boss!</h1>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n          <div class=\"j-content txt--left pt--0 desktop-xl-pt--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <p>When your dog is beaming with joy and wagging his tail, you know he is happy and that makes you, the owner, totally happy too. After all, that's what you do it for, right? Voskes has a lot of snacks in its range that give our four-legged friends an extra treat. Why? Just because your faithful companion deserves it!</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                                <div class=\"section section--none section--padding bg-c--white txt-c--nero heading-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container\" style=\"justify-content: center;\"><div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6 desktop-3\">  <div class=\"j-card bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero\" data-type=\"container\" data-lazyload=\"true\" data-background-image=\"/uploads/bg_image/bg_image-soft_en_chewy1-background_image-48-53.webp\" style=\"background-size: contain;\">\n    <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"head\" data-no-border=\"\" data-no-padding=\"\">\n\n                  <div class=\"ar ar--square\">\n            <div class=\"ar__content\">\n\n                \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"body\">\n            <div class=\"j-card txt--center\" data-type=\"title\">Soft en chewy treats</div>\n            <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"content\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </div><div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6 desktop-3\">  <div class=\"j-card bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero\" data-type=\"container\" data-lazyload=\"true\" data-background-image=\"/uploads/bg_image/bg_image-hondenkoekjes1-background_image-48-54.webp\" style=\"background-size: contain;\">\n    <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"head\" data-no-border=\"\" data-no-padding=\"\">\n\n                  <div class=\"ar ar--square\">\n            <div class=\"ar__content\">\n\n                \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"body\">\n            <div class=\"j-card txt--center\" data-type=\"title\">کوکی‌ها</div>\n            <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"content\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </div><div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6 desktop-3\">  <div class=\"j-card bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero\" data-type=\"container\" data-lazyload=\"true\" data-background-image=\"/uploads/bg_image/bg_image-vleesrollen1-background_image-48-55.webp\" style=\"background-size: contain;\">\n    <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"head\" data-no-border=\"\" data-no-padding=\"\">\n\n                  <div class=\"ar ar--square\">\n            <div class=\"ar__content\">\n\n                \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"body\">\n            <div class=\"j-card txt--center\" data-type=\"title\">Meat strips and rolls</div>\n            <div class=\"j-card\" data-type=\"content\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-45\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-shutterstock_11222855361-images-38-45.webp\" alt=\"SOFT CHEWY SNACKS for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>SOFT CHEWY SNACKS</h2><p>Voskes' soft &amp; chewy snacks are hugely sought after by dogs. They are semi-soft and therefore easy to chew. These tasty chicken-based treats come in several varieties. A delicious piece of dried chicken breast fillet or chicken breast enriched with duck, fish or lamb; tasty calcium bones with chicken; chicken sushi or a twisted stick with chicken and fish.... They are the ideal treat to give your four-legged friend an extra treat. Every dog loves it!</p><a href=\"/en//dog-treats/soft-chewy-treats\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصولات</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-46\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--chicken link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-shutterstock_23810796011-images-38-46.webp\" alt=\"IT'S COOKIE TIME!\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>IT'S COOKIE TIME!</h2><p>When you have a nice cup of coffee or tea with a delicious biscuit to go with it, your doggo is sure to be sitting next to you ready to claim his biscuit too... Vokes has a lot of cookies on offer: small and large biscuits in different shapes and flavours; marrow biscuits large and small, jackers... In our wide range, there is a cookie suitable for every breed and age. Plenty of choice to treat your four-legged friend during your coffee or tea moment too.</p><a href=\"/en/dog-treats/biscuits.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">همه طعم‌ها را ببینید</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-47\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--salmon link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-vleesstrips_visual1-images-38-47.webp\" alt=\"MEAT STRIPS AND ROLLS\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>MEAT STRIPS AND ROLLS</h2><p>Convenient semi-soft treats for your four-legged friend with beef or with lamb and rice. They can be given as a whole or possibly also in pieces for the slightly greedier dogs. They are available in a handy, sealable bucket.</p><a href=\"/en/dog-treats/soft-chewy-treats?filter=meat_rolls\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصولات</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            </div>"
